{"4778540": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lucid Cats", "steam_appid": 4778540, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4778540/extras/d550d1d4df9ea9ffdb612642c0b01ac9.poster.avif?t=1787406687\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4778540/extras/d550d1d4df9ea9ffdb612642c0b01ac9.webm?t=1787406687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4778540/extras/d550d1d4df9ea9ffdb612642c0b01ac9.mp4?t=1787406687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lucid Cats is an online co-op horror game for up to four players featuring creepy monsters, liminal procedurally generated dream levels, and proximity voice-chat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FALL ASLEEP</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wake together in a shared dream. Weird, nostalgic, and full of valuables to take.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LOOT THE DREAM</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Valuables are instantly collected to your name, however, you can only keep them if you find the dream exit and meet the quota.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PROCEDURAL LEVELS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A weird-core, dream-core descent into places that are nostalgic, unsettling, and laid out differently every time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LAPTOP UPGRADES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Security cameras, valuable trackers, and more, your Laptop is your best friend for navigating the dream world and succeeding with your friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FIND THE EXIT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity-voice-chat to guide and immerse. Find the way out to keep your haul. If you die in the dream, you wake with nothing.  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4778540/extras/423a01f39cc80fd980e1eeeee218a400.poster.avif?t=1787406687\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4778540/extras/423a01f39cc80fd980e1eeeee218a400.webm?t=1787406687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4778540/extras/423a01f39cc80fd980e1eeeee218a400.mp4?t=1787406687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4778540/extras/d550d1d4df9ea9ffdb612642c0b01ac9.poster.avif?t=1787406687\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4778540/extras/d550d1d4df9ea9ffdb612642c0b01ac9.webm?t=1787406687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4778540/extras/d550d1d4df9ea9ffdb612642c0b01ac9.mp4?t=1787406687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lucid Cats is an online co-op horror game for up to four players featuring creepy monsters, liminal procedurally generated dream levels, and proximity voice-chat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FALL ASLEEP</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wake together in a shared dream. Weird, nostalgic, and full of valuables to take.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LOOT THE DREAM</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Valuables are instantly collected to your name, however, you can only keep them if you find the dream exit and meet the quota.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PROCEDURAL LEVELS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A weird-core, dream-core descent into places that are nostalgic, unsettling, and laid out differently every time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LAPTOP UPGRADES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Security cameras, valuable trackers, and more, your Laptop is your best friend for navigating the dream world and succeeding with your friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FIND THE EXIT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity-voice-chat to guide and immerse. Find the way out to keep your haul. If you die in the dream, you wake with nothing.  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4778540/extras/423a01f39cc80fd980e1eeeee218a400.poster.avif?t=1787406687\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4778540/extras/423a01f39cc80fd980e1eeeee218a400.webm?t=1787406687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4778540/extras/423a01f39cc80fd980e1eeeee218a400.mp4?t=1787406687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>", "short_description": "An online co-op horror extraction game. Fall asleep, loot a shared nightmare, find the escape to keep your valuables.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4778540/a7eca735be2b883b76eb788d1e84dd5ff8de96df/header.jpg?t=1787406687", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4778540/bba884743d514ce7f8ab9d548bce922fe8442029/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787406687", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamst